      "zh": "约有四万人都准备打仗，在耶和华面前过去，到耶利哥的平原，等候上阵。",
      "en": "About 40,000 battle-ready troops[NOTE:1] marched past the Lord to fight[NOTE:2] on the rift valley plains[NOTE:3] of Jericho.[NOTE:4]",
